{"fps": 30, "totalFrames": 1701, "lines": [{"i": 0, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Your Pisces friend got one smile and planned the wedding.", "from": 0, "to": 74}, {"i": 1, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "It was the barista and she already named their three children.", "from": 78, "to": 165}, {"i": 2, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "That's Mila who's dreamy and kind and mostly in her head.", "from": 169, "to": 255}, {"i": 3, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "She cries at sunsets. She says sorry to furniture.", "from": 259, "to": 347}, {"i": 4, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "She's picked the wedding dress, the song, and the dog.", "from": 351, "to": 417}, {"i": 5, "speaker": "sara", "text": "Mila, you don't even know his name.", "from": 421, "to": 497}, {"i": 6, "speaker": "mila", "text": "His name tag says Sam. It's literally fate.", "from": 501, "to": 590}, {"i": 7, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Every morning she comes back, and every morning he smiles.", "from": 593, "to": 697}, {"i": 8, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Then a woman walks behind the counter.", "from": 701, "to": 751}, {"i": 9, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "She kisses the barista and she's wearing a ring.", "from": 762, "to": 825}, {"i": 10, "speaker": "wife", "text": "Babe, you forgot your lunch again.", "from": 829, "to": 881}, {"i": 11, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Mila turns around and walks straight into the glass door.", "from": 885, "to": 956}, {"i": 12, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "So what's going on inside a Pisces?", "from": 960, "to": 1032}, {"i": 13, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Picture a fish tank labelled DAYDREAMS.", "from": 1035, "to": 1091}, {"i": 14, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "It's huge and it's always overflowing.", "from": 1094, "to": 1163}, {"i": 15, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Next to it a dial labelled REALITY fell off years ago.", "from": 1166, "to": 1261}, {"i": 16, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "A tap marked TEARS that nobody can close.", "from": 1265, "to": 1331}, {"i": 17, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "And a speaker playing SAD SONGS on repeat.", "from": 1335, "to": 1397}, {"i": 18, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Mila cries for one evening, then feels completely fine.", "from": 1400, "to": 1492}, {"i": 19, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "The next morning, she tries the flower shop instead.", "from": 1496, "to": 1567}, {"i": 20, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "The florist hands her a rose and smiles.", "from": 1571, "to": 1628}, {"i": 21, "speaker": "narrator", "text": "Mila has already named their dog.", "from": 1631, "to": 1677}], "captions": [{"from": 0, "to": 14, "text": "Your Pisces"}, {"from": 14, "to": 28, "text": "friend got"}, {"from": 28, "to": 45, "text": "one smile"}, {"from": 45, "to": 61, "text": "and planned"}, {"from": 61, "to": 78, "text": "the wedding."}, {"from": 78, "to": 85, "text": "It was"}, {"from": 85, "to": 101, "text": "the barista"}, {"from": 101, "to": 118, "text": "and she"}, {"from": 118, "to": 136, "text": "already named"}, {"from": 136, "to": 151, "text": "their three"}, {"from": 151, "to": 169, "text": "children."}, {"from": 169, "to": 184, "text": "That's Mila"}, {"from": 184, "to": 204, "text": "who's dreamy"}, {"from": 204, "to": 218, "text": "and kind"}, {"from": 218, "to": 238, "text": "and mostly"}, {"from": 238, "to": 247, "text": "in her"}, {"from": 247, "to": 259, "text": "head."}, {"from": 259, "to": 272, "text": "She cries"}, {"from": 272, "to": 308, "text": "at sunsets."}, {"from": 308, "to": 317, "text": "She says"}, {"from": 317, "to": 333, "text": "sorry to"}, {"from": 333, "to": 351, "text": "furniture."}, {"from": 351, "to": 362, "text": "She's picked"}, {"from": 362, "to": 371, "text": "the wedding"}, {"from": 371, "to": 381, "text": "dress,"}, {"from": 381, "to": 405, "text": "the song,"}, {"from": 405, "to": 410, "text": "and the"}, {"from": 410, "to": 421, "text": "dog."}, {"from": 421, "to": 438, "text": "\u201cMila,"}, {"from": 438, "to": 454, "text":